# CG-2 (CG-LIVE-2) coherence-validate shadow-compare run output — never commit
# the raw logs. The validator's shadow-compare mode
# (engine/coherence/validator.js → logShadowCompare) appends <date>.jsonl here
# only when COHERENCE_VALIDATE=shadow-compare. Each record carries the would-block
# decision + the fallback text (base|floor) so a human eyeballs every would-be
# swap before any player sees one.
*.jsonl
!.gitignore
